flowchart TD
    A([Push to GitHub]) --> B[Webhook triggers Jenkins]
    B --> C{Jenkinsfile exists?}
    C -- No --> CF[FAIL: pipeline not found<br/>check repo path & script path]
    C -- Yes --> D[Checkout code]
    D --> E[Build & Validate<br/>node --check]
    E -- fails --> EF[FAIL<br/>fix syntax error, rebuild]
    E --> F[Run tests<br/>node --test]
    F --> G{Tests passed?}
    G -- No --> GF[FAIL<br/>test/example-failing.js was toggled]
    G -- Yes --> H[Security check<br/>Trivy scan]
    H --> I[Build Docker image]
    I --> J[Run container<br/>unique name + BUILD_NUMBER]
    J --> K{Container healthy?}
    K -- No --> KF[FAIL<br/>port clash / app crash / HEALTHCHECK]
    K -- Yes --> L[Health check<br/>curl /health]
    L --> M{status ok?}
    M -- No --> MF[FAIL<br/>container unhealthy]
    M -- Yes --> N[Cleanup container]
    N --> O([BUILD SUCCESS])

    subgraph FailurePaths["Failure paths"]
        CF
        EF
        GF
        KF
        MF
    end
